{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Demo is The first about 10 minutes of the game And may be changed for the better as the game is developed. This has beginning story elements in it about Sara Crow an otherworldly Santa Claws who crafts special items for her and her dimension out of the veins of humans. The demo is about 10 minutes and the whole game will be roughly an hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is the beginning of the journey you will take into a land full of questions. Who is Sara Crow?, What is Vein-Weaver Knitting?, Will you survive this dimension?, Where did this place come from? How do you destroy this horror of a reality? Can you use Vein-Weaver Knitting good and not evil? Your Thoughts may race to find answers to many question. The demo introduces you to some of these questions. The game will give you some answers and may leave you guessing and wanting more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Roughly first 10 minutes or so of the game is free in this hand crafted demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The beginning of testing your skills to see if you can survive this demented dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Demo and game will most likely be changed over time\u00a0 based on community\u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 suggestions.\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Auto Saves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Check Points</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Intriguing Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Exciting Game Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Spooky Atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Voice Acting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Possibility Of Speed Running</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Open To Community Suggestions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Try The Demo Or Game Make A Suggestion And I'll See What I Can Do.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947090?t=1755223706